{"title":"Sakura","ru":"Sakura","kind":"character","url":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/Sakura","blocks":[{"tag":"p","text":"Sakura (さくら) — человек из The Earth, главный герой My First Tamagotchi. Это любопытная и неуклюжая молодая девушка, которая на протяжении всей манги учится заботиться о Ufufutchi."}],"imageSource":"","gallery":[{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Sakuratamagocchi.PNG","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/81/Sakuratamagocchi.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20191013031910","caption":"Sakuratamagocchi.PNG","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/8/81/Sakuratamagocchi.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20191013031910"}],"related":[]}